# bed_putin (kenshi-k16.2.224.2; verify ask of kenshi-k16.2.224). The player's Carrier and a KO'd squadmate (Sleeper) on the floor-1 landing of a Hub Storm House,
# beside its bed (-51187 1647 2598). radius=150 clears every default-world squad within 150 u of the centre; the file places no other squad: nobody to
# attack or wake the Sleeper (ko=100000 keeps it down for the whole check). Only the player's characters are ever ordered: the playtester selects the Carrier,
# RMBs the Sleeper (lift: the Carrier picks the body up), then RMBs the bed (order 60 action 9 from a carrier: the carried one is put into the bed,
# KO + asleep + the sleepinbed pose tail; k16.6.216 / k16.6.217, drawn in the bed by k16.2.224.1).
